cvise-reduced from cpp17_goto_symex_state_header: a class template
with an anonymous-struct member of the element type (which has only
an int constructor), instantiated through a member alias, makes the
front end look for a zero-argument constructor -- "found no match for
symbol 'symbol_exprt'" with empty argument types, and the enclosing
statements are dropped.  g++/clang++/valgrind clean.
